==Battleground==
*1 [[Pumpkin Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 22~24 seconds<sup>660f~720f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 22~24 seconds<sup>660f~720f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 22~24 seconds<sup>660f~720f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Pumpkin Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**9 [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

